{"data":[{"conversation_id":"1874018133251678701","created_at":"2024-12-31T09:01:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1874018133251678701"],"id":"1874018133251678701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1455,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昨天跟往常一样找御用Tony老师剪了发，问我过年前还剪不剪，想了下年前肯定涨价，我说不剪。剪完之后又说「2024你最后一次剪发，给你整点别的造型」，哗啦哗啦10分钟吹了帅气的发型，果然是御用Tony，情绪价值拉满。我在想自己在做产品的时候是不是也可以在用户的特殊日子来点小彩蛋，这样就很有意思。"},{"conversation_id":"1873904768034496777","created_at":"2024-12-31T01:31:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1873904768034496777"],"id":"1873904768034496777","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1280,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果你对即将发布的产品有压力，怕面对客户评价，可以先拉10个熟人试用，看看第一波反馈评价，这样压力会小很多。"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_1873552421554995200"]},"conversation_id":"1873552491222352187","created_at":"2024-12-30T02:11:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1873552491222352187"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/3P7uYvRtjO","end":34,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/luobogooooo/status/1873552491222352187/photo/1","media_key":"3_1873552421554995200","start":11,"url":"https://t.co/3P7uYvRtjO"}]},"id":"1873552491222352187","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1216,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一大早给我一锤子☹️ https://t.co/3P7uYvRtjO"},{"conversation_id":"1873225510987415727","created_at":"2024-12-29T04:32:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1873225510987415727"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/JamesAI/status…","end":115,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/JamesAI/status/1872631414790963421","start":92,"url":"https://t.co/j9p4nI1rsZ"}]},"id":"1873225510987415727","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3850,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我觉得独立开发是最考验主观能动性的，最大的自由是你能决定自己做什么，不做什么。上班很多时候是没有这个权利，更多是被动执行，当然你也可以在公司内主动做很多事情，但总的来说还是很多限制。 https://t.co/j9